      "raw": "I may have missed something basic in the rules when I read them last night but heroes go to their incapacitated side with rewards underneath and then you add a new hero to the game correct?  So the incap heroes keep acting? Thus youd have in a 4 man game 4 active heroes plus any incapped heroes also acting? \r\n\r\nIm assuming they stay active since rewards are available under their character card if they are revived.  \r\n\r\nAssuming I havent made a fatal error in my logic then does that mean a 4 man game with an incapped hero that gets resurrected would essentially have a 5th hero?  I feel like im missing some key bits of info. \r\n\r\nThanks!",
