      "created_at": "2018-08-28T15:53:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If you Ressurect any hero that was incapped before Redacted takes over it goes to the box and is available for later. &nbsp; If it’s after Redacted takes over then you can only resurrect one hero in your play area through Rites of Revival and not mulitple ones from one play area. &nbsp;So if you still have an active hero you are unable to use Rites of Revival on any incapped heroes you control.&nbsp;</p>",
